DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The eeaapp driver supports the older Ensoniq AudioPCI and other ES1370 based
     sound cards, such as the Creative Labs SoundBlaster PCI64 and PCI128.
     The driver also supports many revisions of the more modern Ensoniq Au‐
     dioPCI 97 (ES1371), as well as the Ensoniq CT5880 and the Creative Labs
     Ectiva 1938.

